title: 'C-c r n u : skg-diffView-goto-next-unprocessed-change'
pid: bba9400f-2ebc-43a8-9b28-d59c3d4db86f
body: |2-
  The same, visiting only headlines with change facts that are not
  processed: a headline counts as processed when every change it names
  is marked. Past the last one it
  says "No further unprocessed change".
